    "chunk_text": "from \u00fe\u00e6m arwyr\u00f0an were Sancte Paulini \u00fe\u00e6t riht Ge eac mid his ealdormonnum, \u00fea \u00f0e he wiseste & snottroste wiste, \u00fe\u00e6t he gelomlice mid him Ge eac he seolfa, mid \u00fey \u00fee he w\u00e6s in gecynde se gleawesta mon, oft longe ana s\u00e6t swigende \u00d0\u00e6re tide eac swylce \u00fe\u00e6s apostolican se\u00f0les biscop Bonefatius papa sende Eadwini gretinge & Swylce eac w\u00e6s sum Godgespr\u00e6ce & heofonlic onwrigenis, \u00fee him geo seo godcunde arf\u00e6stnis Mid \u00fey he \u00fea se biscop Paulinus geseah, \u00fe\u00e6t he unea\u00f0elice meahte \u00f0a heannesse \u00fe\u00e6s cynelican Ne ylde he hit \u00fea leng; ac eode sona to \u00feam cyninge & hine monade \u00fe\u00e6t he his gehat gefylde, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00de\u00e6s \u00feis godgespr\u00e6ce & \u00feeos onwrigenis \u00feisses gemetes. Mid \u00fey hine ehte \u00e6\u00f0elfri\u00f0, se \u00f0e \u00e6r him cyning w\u00e6s, & \u00feurh missenlice stowe he monigra geara Ond he lustlice hine onfeng & him geheht, \u00fe\u00e6t he swa don wolde swa he hine b\u00e6d. \u00c6fter \u00feon \u00fea \u00e6\u00feelfri\u00f0 se cyning hine \u00fe\u00e6r geahsode, \u00fe\u00e6t he mid R\u00e6dwold \u00feone cyning w\u00e6s, \u00fea Sende he eft \u00e6fteran si\u00f0e \u00e6rendwrecan; synde \u00feriddan si\u00f0e, & maran gife micle & feoh, \u00feonne he \u00dea w\u00e6s his mod \u00e6ghw\u00e6\u00f0er ge mid \u00fe\u00e6m beotungum gebreged ge mid \u00fe\u00e6m geofum gewemmed, \u00dea w\u00e6s sum cyninges \u00feegn his freond se getreowesta, \u00fe",
